  "project_description": "This module provides an Windows style file explorer or a Ubuntu style Nautilus.\n\n \n\n \n ⚠️ Info \n This module provides its own \"media\" entity. \nIf you are looking for a integration with Media entities check the Media Folders module. \n\n \n \n Back to top \n\n Features \n \n Entity reference widget \n Folder CRUD permissions \n Folder inherit permissions \n Drag to upload \n Drag and drop to move \n File lock and file revisions \n \n \n Back to top \n\n Installation \n \n Install as you would normally install a contributed Drupal module. For further\n\ninformation, see Installing Drupal Modules. \n \n \n Back to top \n\n Post-Installation \n Once you've enabled the module, go to \"/admin/content/file-explorer\"\n\n \n Back to top \n\n Dependencies \n jQuery UI Droppable \n\n Back to top",
